## Whole-domain counts

- valid oracle: 128 check combos × 2 ID relations × 6 finding
  classes = 1536 combinations, each through Build-seal,
  Build-flipped-refusal, Decode-seal, Decode-flipped-refusal.
- mode-authority grid: 3 purposes × 2 modes × 2 entries = 12
  cells + 4 invalid-purpose cells; every Decode mismatch cell
  first proves the sealed id recomputes.
- read-ref relation oracle: 7 claim pairs + 2 missing + 3
  sibling relations = 12 cells × 2 entries.
- mode oracle: 2 closed + 19 neighbors (Build/Decode/predicate).
- kind oracle: 3 closed + 14 neighbors (Build/Decode/predicate).
- member census: 16 + 5 + 23 derived members (reflection +
  sealed-envelope derivation) × missing/extra/miscased/6-wrong-
  types/duplicated at the decode entries.
- scalar strings: 5 + 2 + 8 value-classified members ×
  malformed probes at the decode entries.
