  entries + heads + extensions.

## Reviewer rework guards (epic rejection patterns)

- (a) circular expectations: every refusal asserts a literal
  member/code fragment from the pinned text at the production
  entry; no `got == pkg.Constant` assertions.
- (b) helper vs entry: shared gates (`checkNativeIdentityMatch`,
  `checkEvidenceOrder`, `checkValidAgreement`/`decideValid`,
  `checkModeAuthority`/`modeForAuthorityPurpose`,
  `checkReadRefs`) are AST-pinned reachable from BOTH sibling
  entries; narrowings kill through the entries, one per entry
